              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nyasaye naboola ari Lole, emuheelesiye buli miani echibalusinjia imwo echili khushibala shiosi, nende buli musaala okulimwo ebiamo biakwo ebili nende imwo; khwinywe bilabeetsanga ebiliibwa bieenywe; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.1.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
