        },
        {
          "text": "khandi khubuli shilamu eshiokhushibala, nende khubuli linyonyi eliokhwikulu, nende khubuli shindu eshimoolanga khushibala, eshilimwo obulamu, ndabiheelesiye buli miani chiamasaafu bibe ebiliibwa; nikaba kario. ",
